<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS7" title="In 5. Experimental Results ‣ SmellBench: Evaluating LLM Agents on Architectural Code Smell Repair" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.7 </span>Ranking Robustness</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In SmellBench: Evaluating LLM Agents on Architectural Code Smell Repair" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Discussion</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In 6. Discussion ‣ SmellBench: Evaluating LLM Agents on Architectural Code Smell Repair" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">The architectural reasoning gap.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 6. Discussion ‣ SmellBench: Evaluating LLM Agents on Architectural Code Smell Repair" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Representative failure patterns.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 6. Discussion ‣ SmellBench: Evaluating LLM Agents on Architectural Code Smell Repair" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Cascading repair mechanisms.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In 6. Discussion ‣ SmellBench: Evaluating LLM Agents on Architectural Code Smell Repair" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">False positive identification as a separable skill.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In 6. Discussion ‣ SmellBench: Evaluating LLM Agents on Architectural Code Smell Repair" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Implications for deployment.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px6" title="In 6. Discussion ‣ SmellBench: Evaluating LLM Agents on Architectural Code Smell Repair" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Inter-agent agreement and calibration.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
