<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 7. Threats to Validity ‣ SmellBench: Evaluating LLM Agents on Architectural Code Smell Repair" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Internal validity.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 7. Threats to Validity ‣ SmellBench: Evaluating LLM Agents on Architectural Code Smell Repair" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Construct validity.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
